    "en": "The module tree lagged behind the code: 91 fingerprint drifts, several new files with no module (Codex agent config, setting-panel doc generator, repo-root csproj/.vs artifacts), and bootstrap.w5-gameplay was still one flat leaf carrying 33 source files and 7 rpcs. This change re-syncs the tree and splits that node so the gameplay layer is drillable.",
    "zh": "模块树落后于代码：91 处指纹漂移；多个新文件无归属模块（Codex 的 agent 配置、设置面板文档生成脚本、仓库根 csproj/.vs 产物）；bootstrap.w5-gameplay 仍是挂了 33 个源文件和 7 个 rpc 的扁平叶子。本次变更把树重新对齐代码，并拆分该节点，让玩法层可下钻。"
  },
